WEBVTT

00:47:58.829 --> 00:48:02.538
and one thing is it means that there
are different kinds of sorrow

00:48:02.788 --> 00:48:08.371
and some of them are sorrow. Our sad in
the moment and others are sad forever.

00:48:09.204 --> 00:48:11.871
And, you know, so I think that's
a really important thing that

00:48:11.871 --> 00:48:14.038
I try to remember still in
my life, that it's like,

00:48:14.038 --> 00:48:16.704
is this a sorrow that I'm going
to carry with me forever,

00:48:16.954 --> 00:48:21.038
or is it a sorrow that is like a crucible
and I have to endure it

00:48:21.038 --> 00:48:23.496
and then I will be better
for it that I you know,

00:48:23.496 --> 00:48:24.871
that's what I when I wrote as sugar,

00:48:24.871 --> 00:48:26.746
you've got to be brave enough
to break your own heart.

00:48:26.788 --> 00:48:29.204
I was talking about exactly that
thing where, you know,

00:48:29.204 --> 00:48:32.371
I had to make a decision that caused
me and another person pain,